rl":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:web","name":"platform:web","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310664,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA2NjQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:input","name":"topic:input","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-06-10T17:07:31Z","updated_at":"2025-06-11T16:23:39Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in master, v4.5.dev5, and v4.4.1.stable.\n\n### System information\n\nChrome, Firefox and Safari on MacOS -- Godot v4.5.dev (fc523ec5f) - macOS Sequoia (15.4.1) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Metal (Forward+) - integrated Apple M1 Max (Apple7) - Apple M1 Max (10 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\n\nMacOS shortcut overrides are not propagated to the web export. For example `cmd + delete` removes a word instead of deleting all previous text. `option + delete` is the shortcut to delete one word at a time but instead it does nothing. This issue impact all web exports including the editor.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nTry any MacOS shortcut override.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[macos_web_shortcuts_2025-06-10_19-04-27.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20676982/macos_web_shortcuts_2025-06-10_19-04-27.zip)\n\nOr https://editor.godotengine.org where the shortcuts are not working as expected.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107371/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"c